@title Crane template at 1920: New from template, fill a field, the cover page fills in
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
wait 20
click_text File
wait 6
move 260 466
wait 8
shot menu-new-from-template
click 600 466
wait 20
shot template-opened
expect "New crane project"
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text project settings
wait 8
key Return
wait 12
shot project-settings
tree Customer
click 983 461
text Acme Cranes
key Tab
wait 8
shot customer-typed
click 1162 813
wait 10
click 150 123
text Front
wait 10
shot pages-filtered
click 150 175
wait 20
shot cover-title
click 150 233
wait 20
shot cover-structure
check_layout
